# The path into play: Select on NEW GAME, three Selects to type a name, wheel back to the tick,
# Select to accept it, then Selects on whatever follows, with the screen captured at each step.
600: select
900: select
1200: select
1500: select
1800: wheel -40
2000: shot
2200: select
2500: shot
3000: select
3300: shot
4000: shot
5000: shot
6000: shot
6000: quit
